# data.py
# Numbers measured from the REAL NFL: every regular-season play of 2023, 2024
# and 2025 (nflverse play-by-play data, github.com/nflverse/nflverse-data).
# Generated by a script from that data; the sim uses these as its baseline,
# and player ratings push results up or down from there.
#
# Do not hand-edit the big tables. To change how the sim plays, use tuning.py.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Play calling: chance of a pass (vs a run) by situation. A logistic model fit
# to real plays: add the numbers for the down & distance, field zone and game
# state, then turn the total into a probability. It matches real pass rates
# within about 1% in every situation.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
